      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're feeling a deep weariness with the effort of continuing, and that the idea of quiet acceptance feels like the only honest option left. When the internal struggle feels so vast and the effort seems pointless, that sense of peace in surrender can become very compelling. Please remember that even when it feels like nothing is left, there are still people who care about you and want to help you find a different kind of quiet. Reaching out to a professional can help you navigate these overwhelming feelings without having to face the darkness alone.",
